  "reference": "Ŵak 20",
  "verseCount": 45,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aisalaeli akuliŵicila cile kuputa ngondo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aisalaeli wosope ŵa ku tyocela ku Dani kumpoto mpaka ku Belesheba kum'mwela, pamo ni ŵa ku Giliyadi kungopoko lyuŵa, ŵasongene ni cakulinga cimpepe pameso pa AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ku malo gakulambila ku Misipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵakulongolela ŵa ngosyo syosope ku Isalaeli ŵayice ku msongano wa ŵandu ŵa Mlunguwu, nipo asilikali ŵakwenda pasi ŵapali 400,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa jele ndaŵiji ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini ŵapikene kuti Aisalaeli ŵane wosope ŵaliji ali asongene ku Misipa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aisalaeli ŵawusisye kuti, “Atusalile, cele cakusakalaci catendekwe camtuli?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlefi jwele ŵamkwakwe ŵanondi ŵiŵawulajidwe ŵala ŵajanjile kuti, “Ŵamkwangu ŵanondi ni une twajile ku Gibeya ku upande wa Benjamini kuti tukagone. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acalume ŵa ku Gibeya ŵayice kukundanda une ni kujisyungulila nyumbajo cilo. Jemanjajo ŵasosaga kumbulaga une, m'malo mwakwe ŵatesile cikululu ni ŵamkwanguwo, mpaka ŵawile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Une najigele cilu cakwe, ni kucikata m'yipiciti, ni kutumisya cipiciti cimo ku lukosyo lulilose mwa ngosyo 12 sya ku Aisalaeli. Ŵele ŵanduŵa atesile cindu cakogoya, cakusakala ni cakutesya soni pasikati petu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanja wosope mli Aisalaeli. Ana uwe tutende uli ni cele cinduci?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu wosope ŵene ŵajimi yalumo ni ŵatite kuti, “Pangali jwalijose jwa uwe jutajawule kumusi, kanga akutama mu tenti kapena m'nyumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yicitutende uwe ni ayi: citulondole yisango ni kwasagula ŵandu ŵitakawutande msinda wa Gibeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu likumi mwa ŵandu 100 ŵaliwose ŵakutyocela ku ngosyo syosope sya ku Isalaeli, takapeleceje yakulya kwa asilikali, nipo ŵane wosope tacijawula kukupeleka cilango kwa ŵandu ŵa ku Gibeya pa cindu cakogoyaci ni cakutesya soni cacitendekwe ku Isalaeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo ŵandu wosope mu Isalaeli ŵasongene ali akamulene cindu cimo, cele caliji cakuti ajawule akawutande msindawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngosyo sya ku Isalaeli syatumisye ŵamitenga ku upande wosope wene wa lukosyo lwa Benjamini kukwawusya kuti, “Ana cakusakala cimtesileci ni cici? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano jino atupe acalume ŵakusakalawo ŵa mu Gibeyamo, twawulaje kuti tutyosye cindu cakusakalaci mu Isalaeli.” Nambo ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini nginiŵapikanila Aisalaeli acimjawo ŵala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵagambile kwika ku Gibeya kutyocela ku misinda josope ja Benjamini kukumenyana ni Aisalaeli acimjawowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanjajo ŵasongenye asilikali 26,000 lyele lyuŵalyo kutyocela m'misinda mwawo. Ngaŵalanjila asilikali ŵa ku Gibeya 700 ŵakuputila ku mciji ŵiŵasagwile ŵandu ŵa mu msindamo ligongo lya kumanyilila kuputa ngondo. Jwalijose jwa jemanjajo ŵapakombolaga kuponya liganga pa cindu cakulandana ni kaluwumbo nambo ngakulusya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.15+JDG.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.15",
              "JDG.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aisalaeli ŵanewo ŵasonganyisye asilikali ŵakumanyilila kuputa ngondo ŵakwana 400,000.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ngondo jakulimbana ni lukosyo lwa Benjamini",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aisalaeli ŵajile ku Beteli ku malo gakulambilila, kweleko ŵamwusisye Mlungu kuti, “Ana sikati ja uwe, ŵani ŵitatande kwawula kukulutanda lukosyo lwa Benjamini?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE ŵajanjile kuti, “Tiluŵe lukosyo lwa Yuda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kundaŵi kwakwe Aisalaeli ŵawutandite ulendo wakuja kukutaŵa matenti ga cigono ciŵandika ni msinda wa Gibeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanjajo ŵajile kukwatanda asilikali ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini, nipo ŵaŵisile asilikali pa malo gakulolegana ni msinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asilikali ŵa Benjamini ŵakopwece pasa pa msinda wa Gibeya, nipo lyele lyuŵalyo ŵawuleje Aisalaeli 22,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko Aisalaeli ŵajile ku malo gakulambilila kukwalilila AMBUJE mpaka ligulo. Ni ŵawusisye AMBUJE kuti, “Ana tujawule kaŵili tukamenyane ni alongo acimjetu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.22+JDG.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.22",
              "JDG.20.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE ŵajanjile kuti, “Elo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.22+JDG.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.22",
              "JDG.20.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo asilikali ŵa ku Isalaeli ŵalimbisidwe mitima, ni ŵawujile soni ku Gibeya nipo ŵaŵisile asilikali ŵawo pa malo galagala mpela muŵatendele lyuŵa lyandanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.22+JDG.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.22",
              "JDG.20.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.22+JDG.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.22",
              "JDG.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanjajo ŵajesile kuja kukwatanda asilikali ŵa Benjamini kaŵili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asilikali ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini ŵakopwece pasa pa msinda wa Gibeya kaŵili, nipo jele ndaŵiji ŵawuleje asilikali ŵa ku Isalaeli ŵakumanyilila ngondo ŵakwana 18,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko ŵandu wosope ŵa ku Isalaeli ŵajile ku Beteli kukulila. Ŵatemi kweleko pa malo giŵapopelaga AMBUJE, ngalya kalikose mpaka ligulo. Jemanjajo ŵapelece mbopesi ja mkamulano",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni jakutinisya jamitundu josopejo ŵapelece pa malo gakwalambilila AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Libokosi lya Cilanga ca Mlungu lyaliji ku Beteli mu gele masikugo. Finihasi, mwanace jwa Eliyesa soni juŵaliji cisukulu ca Aloni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.27+JDG.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.27",
              "JDG.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni juŵaliji jwakutaga mbopesi jwakwe. Ŵandu ŵala ŵawusisye AMBUJE kuti, “Ana uwe tuwilisye kwawula kukumenyana soni ni acalongo acimjetu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini, kapena tugambe kugonja?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.27+JDG.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.27",
              "JDG.20.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE ŵajanjile kuti, “Mkaputeni ngondo! Malaŵi tinjapeleka jemanjajo myala mwenu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.27+JDG.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.27",
              "JDG.20.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.27+JDG.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.27",
              "JDG.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni Aisalaeli ŵaŵisile asilikali ŵane ŵakuŵilila kusyungulila msinda wa Gibeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko ŵapite soni katatu mwakuyanape kukwatanda asilikali ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini ni ŵaŵisile asilikali ŵawo pa malo gakuputila ngondo mwakulolegana ni msinda wa Gibeya, mpela muŵatendele pandanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asilikali ŵa Benjamini ŵakopwece kukuputa ngondo ni ŵalambucisye kutila kuti atalikangane ni msinda. Mpela mwa kala, jemanjajo ŵatandite kwawulaga ŵane mwa Aisalaeli ŵala pakulanguka pa msewu wakwawula ku Beteli ni pa msewu wakwawula ku Gibeya. Ŵawuleje Aisalaeli ŵakwana makumi gatatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa Benjamini ŵatite, “Twaputile mpela mutwatendele kala mula.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Aisalaeli ŵalilinganyisye kuŵangala mpela akutila kuti ŵatyosye ku msindako aŵe m'misewu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ŵa ngondo jisyene ja Aisalaeli piŵawujile kuja kusongana pa Baala Tamala, acalume ŵiŵasyungulile Gibeya ŵala ŵakwipwice mwacitema m'malo muŵajuŵile m'maganga gakusyungulila msindawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu 10,000 ŵiŵasagwile mwa Aisalaeli wosope, ni ŵiŵawutandite msinda wa Gibeya, nipo ngondo jalimbile. Ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini nginamanyilila kuti ŵasigele panandi kuti ajonasice. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE ŵapundisye Aisalaeli pakwapunda ŵa ngondo ŵa Benjamini. Aisalaeli ŵawuleje amagongo 25,000 lyele lyuŵalyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nombe nawo ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Benjamini ŵamanyilile kuti basi agonjile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mwele muŵapundile Aisalaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likuga lisyesyene lya ngondo ja Aisalaeli lyawujile munyuma kwatila ŵa ngondo ŵa Benjamini ligongo ŵadalilaga ŵa ngondo ŵiŵasisile kusyungulila msinda wa Gibeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵele ŵa ngondoŵa ŵawutucile mwacitema ku Gibeya, ŵabalalice mu msindamo ni kumwulaga jwalijose mwelemo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likuga lisyesyene lya ngondo lya Aisalaeli ni ŵa ngondo ŵiŵajuŵile ŵala ŵaliji ali apangene cimanyisyo cawo. Piŵaliweni liwunde lyalikulungwa lya lyosi lilimkwawula kwinani kutyocela mu msindamo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aisalaeli ŵiŵaliji ku ngondo ŵala ŵaŵajilwe kugalawuka. Jele ndaŵiji ni kuti ŵa ngondo ŵa Benjamini ali ŵawuleje kala asilikali makumi gatatu ŵa Aisalaeli. Ni ŵatite kwa acimsyenepe, “Eya, twaputile jemanjajo mpela mutwatendele pandanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cilocesyo cila cawonece, liwunde lya lyosi lyatandite kwawula kwinani kutyocela mu msindamo. Ŵa ngondo ŵa Benjamini ŵalolite kunyuma kwawo nipo ŵasimonjile kwakogoya piŵawuweni msinda wosope wene uli mkolela moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko Aisalaeli ŵagalawucile, nipo ŵa ngondo ŵa Benjamini ŵabalalice ligongo ŵamanyilile kuti ŵasigele panandi konasika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanjajo ŵawujile munyuma kwatila Aisalaeli ni kutanda kuwutucila ku cipululu, nambo nganapakombola kutila. Ŵasimanice ali pasikati pa likuga lya ngondo lisyesyene ni acalume ŵiŵakopokaga mu msinda ŵala, ni basi ŵajonasile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aisalaeli ŵatejile amagongo ŵala, nipo mwangalecesya ŵatopwesye mpaka ku malo gigaliji kungopoko lyuŵa kwa Gibeya, kupita mcawulaga mosopemo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asilikali ŵakuputa ngondo yakulimba ŵa Benjamini ŵakwanila 18,000 ŵawulajidwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵane ŵagalawice acitililaga ku cipululu ku Lwala lwa Limoni. Nambope soni ŵawulajidwe ŵakwana 5,000 piŵatilaga mu msewu. Aisalaeli ŵapitilisyepe kwatoposya ŵiŵasigelewo ku Gidomu, acawulagaga 2,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakwapwatikanya wosope ŵene pamo asilikali ŵakulimba mtima ŵa Benjamini ŵiŵawulajidwe lyele lyuŵalyo ŵakwanile 25,000.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo acalume 600 ŵapakombwele kutilila ku cipululu ku Liganga lya Limoni, ni ŵatemi kweleko miesi mcece. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 20:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aisalaeli ŵawujile kukwatanda ŵandu ŵa Benjamini ŵiŵasigalile ni kwawulaga wosope ŵene acalume, acakongwe, ni ŵanace ŵakwe, mpaka ni yinyama yakwe. Jemanjajo ŵajocile msinda uliwose mu upandewo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.20.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.20.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
